  parts:
  - id: wall
    numeral: I
    title: The Wall
    subtitle: Hold the sea wall. Keep the core alive.
    intro:
    - Saltmarrow has always had the wall, and the wall has always had the night.
    - Every dusk the sea sends its creatures up the sand. Every dawn the town sells
      what is left of them.
    - Keep the Nuclear Sand Powerplant burning. While it burns, Saltmarrow stands.
    kind: 0
    scene: TideWall
    stages: []
    startSandDollars: 0
    startLevel: 1
  - id: undertow
    numeral: II
    title: The Undertow
    subtitle: Take the war to the sea.
    intro:
    - The engineers found another setting on the core.
    - 'Run it hot enough and the sea steps back: two walls of standing water, and
      the seabed open all the way down.'
    - One night. One tide. March out, find the Heart of the Tide, and end this.
    kind: 1
    scene: 
